      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALL ON BARNEY (1) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished in the minors latest when third (20.29) at this track and may be close to breaking through. Solid record at the distance winning two races. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Good form should continue. LOG ON (2) is first up since finishing seventh (23.75) in a Grade 5 at Richmond over 401m 17 months ago. Form at the trip excellent including two wins. Meets a moderate line up and should run well. RUBY SHELBY (8) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 350m behind Shot Of Whisky (20.57) in a Grade 5. Was a winner prior to that. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. RUSHFORTH BAZ (7) is a course and distance winner who cannot be left out.",
